# Keep the build context small and the images clean: the web image builds the app from source.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.egg-info
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
docs/example-report.json
index.html
tutorial.html
assets
